[00:11.60]1. Jesus loved to share truth and light,
[00:16.98]Bringing happiness to our life.
[00:22.02]On a mountainside, he taught us how to live.
[00:32.37]Seeking God’s will first ev’ry day,
[00:37.60]With a humble heart, he would pray.
[00:42.75]He was kind to all and ready to forgive.
[00:50.15]By God’s light, I can see
[00:55.37]How to live happily.
[01:01.27]By God’s light, I am truly free.
[01:08.27]Happy are these eyes because they see!
[01:21.75]2. When anxieties come our way,
[01:27.73]We will live our lives day by day,
[01:32.71]For Jehovah’s hand provides our daily needs.
[01:42.67]As the lilies grow in the field,
[01:48.87]How the love God shows is revealed!
[01:53.69]If he cares for them, I know he’ll care for me.
[02:01.09]By God’s light, I can see
[02:06.39]How to live happily.
[02:12.19]By God’s light, I am truly free.
[02:19.25]Happy are these eyes because they see!
[02:33.67]3. We will build on rock, not on sand.
[02:40.03]If a storm should come, we will stand.
[02:45.05]Yes, Jehovah’s Word will live in all we do.
[02:54.15]Through the narrow gate, we will go.
[03:00.83]As he guides our way, blessings flow,
[03:06.33]And it leads to life, where all will be made new.
[03:13.93]By God’s light, I can see
[03:18.59]How to live happily.
[03:24.01]By God’s light, I am truly free.
[03:31.67]Happy are these eyes because they see!
